			<div class="content" id="post-content-920490">
									

<p>Even aside from the fact that the Foundation contains SCPs regardless of how beneficial they are in the wild, SCP-069's impersonation is involuntary. Whenever it is alone with any recently dead body, it will turn into that person, regardless of whether it's someone who actually deserves a "second chance".</p>
